 action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will disguise as a highly skilled hacker and infiltrate the mysterious DoubleL R&amp;D company. By hacking into terminals, intercepting communications, and cracking firewalls, you will gain access to the truth hidden behind experimental records and R&amp;D materials. Behind every experimenter lies a secret, and the clues will piece together the complete truth, revealing the company's unknown conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642420/extras/4cb5930d95ed48171ebe6ab9900a244c.avif?t=1759546456\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-energy mystery solving, challenging the limits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DoubleL has set up a large number of security systems and electronic puzzles inside, from password access control to logical pathways, from clue combinations to physical device operations, each puzzle tests your reasoning and hands-on skills. The game has hundreds of puzzles with increasing complexity, waiting for you who like to solve puzzles with your brain to dig out the hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642420/extras/c2ecf2e134297f5faea67b6b3f26d987.avif?t=1759546456\" width=1600 height=998 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Utilize the terrain, sneak and run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some areas are heavily guarded, and cracking alone is not enough. You need to observe the terrain, look for ventilation ducts, hidden passages or use props to disguise your identity, and even run and jump to get favorable treasures. The fusion of infiltration and parkour brings you an intense and exciting adventure experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam